\fs32 \cf2 Fallback patterns\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa180\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf3 Production systems need resiliency.\
When a primary model experiences throttling, timeout issues, or availability problems, the application can retry against a secondary model. The caller receives a response in the same format and can optionally inspect whether fallback was used.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

