\fs32 \cf2 Operational benefits for enterprise teams\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa180\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf3 This architecture provides measurable operational advantages beyond model portability.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa180\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf2 Faster evaluation cycles\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa180\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf3 New models can be introduced behind feature flags and compared against existing workloads without redeploying applications.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa180\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf2 Cost management\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa180\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf3 Expensive reasoning tasks can use premium models while simpler workloads use lower-cost alternatives.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa180\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf2 Improved resiliency\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa180\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf3 Fallback routing reduces dependence on a single model provider or deployment.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa180\partightenfactor0

